1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,587
Cook a restaurant-quality steak at home in
three steps.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:04,356
One.

3
00:00:04,648 --> 00:00:07,645
Pat the steak completely dry, and salt it

4
00:00:07,655 --> 00:00:09,848
generously on every side.

5
00:00:10,033 --> 00:00:10,671
Two.

6
00:00:10,962 --> 00:00:13,379
Sear in a very hot pan for two

7
00:00:13,389 --> 00:00:14,839
to three minutes a side.

8
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,360
Don't move it.

9
00:00:16,567 --> 00:00:17,286
Three.

10
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:20,621
Rest the steak for five minutes before
slicing

11
00:00:20,631 --> 00:00:21,918
across the grain.

12
00:00:22,133 --> 00:00:24,861
The full seven-step guide is on the
channel.

13
00:00:25,036 --> 00:00:28,181
Follow WikiTube for a new how-to every
day.
